# **Rhythm Culture perform at sunrise at Mooloolaba**

[![Iron Man 2013](/media/2013/09/DSC02400-001.jpg)](/rhythm-culture-drum-at-sunrise-for-iron-man-2013/dsc02400-001/) Rhythm Culture performing at Iron Man 2013 A 4am departure for this event had us curious! and WOW does it get any better than drumming at sunrise on the beach with incredibly talented artists?! NO! This gig was an absolute highlight for us and thank you to Iron Man 2013 for having us! We hope to do it again next time! :)
